<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Dishi Fleet DashCam – Sales Page</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Outfit:wght@300;400;600;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --navy: #0a0f2e;
    --blue: #1a2fff;
    --cyan: #00d4ff;
    --red: #e8192c;
    --white: #ffffff;
    --light: #f0f4ff;
    --gold: #f5c518;
  }

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
    background: var(--navy);
    color: var(--white);
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* HERO */
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #050a1e 0%, #0d1540 40%, #0a1060 100%);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 60px 80px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    width: 600px; height: 600px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0,212,255,0.12) 0%, transparent 70%);
    top: -100px; right: -100px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .hero::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    width: 400px; height: 400px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(26,47,255,0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);
    bottom: -80px; left: 100px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .hero-text { position: relative; z-index: 2; }
  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--red);
    color: white;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 6px 16px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .hero-title {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(52px, 7vw, 92px);
    line-height: 0.95;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .hero-title span { color: var(--cyan); }
  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    margin: 20px 0 40px;
    max-width: 460px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .hero-cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--red);
    color: white;
    padding: 16px 36px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    transition: all 0.3s;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: #c8101f; transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .btn-secondary {
    border: 2px solid var(--cyan);
    color: var(--cyan);
    padding: 14px 34px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover { background: rgba(0,212,255,0.1); }
  .hero-img {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .hero-img img {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 540px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    box-shadow: 0 40px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    animation: floatUp 3s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes floatUp {
    0%,100% { transform: translateY(0); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-12px); }
  }

  /* TRUST BAR */
  .trust-bar {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    padding: 20px 80px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 60px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .trust-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }
  .trust-item .icon {
    font-size: 22px;
  }

  /* SECTION STYLES */
  section { padding: 90px 80px; }
  .section-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--cyan);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 62px);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .section-sub {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    max-width: 560px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
  }

  /* SALES SPEECH */
  .speech-section {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #07102a 0%, #0c1845 100%);
  }
  .speech-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .speech-img img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
  }
  .speech-body {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.82);
    line-height: 1.85;
  }
  .speech-body p { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .speech-body strong { color: var(--cyan); font-weight: 700; }
  .speech-highlight {
    border-left: 4px solid var(--red);
    padding: 20px 24px;
    background: rgba(232,25,44,0.08);
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: white;
    margin: 28px 0;
  }

  /* FEATURES GRID */
  .features-section {
    background: #050c20;
  }
  .features-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
  }
  .features-header .section-sub {
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .features-img-wide {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 760px;
    display: block;
    margin: 0 auto 60px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }
  .features-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .feature-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 12px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: transform 0.3s, border-color 0.3s;
  }
  .feature-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    border-color: rgba(0,212,255,0.3);
  }
  .feature-card img {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16/10;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .feature-card-body {
    padding: 20px;
  }
  .feature-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--red);
    color: white;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .feature-card-title {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 17px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: white;
  }
  .feature-card-desc {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* PRICING */
  .pricing-section {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #060e25 0%, #0a1540 100%);
  }
  .pricing-header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 60px; }
  .pricing-header .section-sub { margin: 0 auto; }
  .pricing-img {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 800px;
    display: block;
    margin: 0 auto 60px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
  }
  .pricing-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .pricing-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 40px 36px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .pricing-card.featured {
    border-color: var(--cyan);
    background: rgba(0,212,255,0.06);
  }
  .pricing-card.featured::before {
    content: 'MOST POPULAR';
    position: absolute;
    top: -14px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: var(--cyan);
    color: var(--navy);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    padding: 5px 16px;
    border-radius: 20px;
  }
  .plan-name {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: 28px;
    color: var(--cyan);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .plan-price {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: 52px;
    color: white;
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .plan-price sup { font-size: 24px; vertical-align: super; }
  .plan-gst {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .plan-features { list-style: none; }
  .plan-features li {
    padding: 10px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 10px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .plan-features li::before {
    content: '✓';
    color: var(--cyan);
    font-weight: 700;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 1px;
  }

  /* RECORDING INFO */
  .recording-section {
    background: #070e28;
  }
  .recording-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .recording-img img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
  }

  /* CTA FOOTER */
  .cta-section {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--red) 0%, #a50f1c 100%);
    text-align: center;
    padding: 100px 80px;
  }
  .cta-section .section-title { color: white; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .cta-sub {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .cta-phone {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: 48px;
    color: white;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  .btn-white {
    background: white;
    color: var(--red);
    padding: 18px 48px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 16px;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    transition: all 0.3s;
  }
  .btn-white:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero, section { padding: 60px 28px; }
    .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hero-img { display: none; }
    .speech-grid, .recording-grid, .pricing-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .trust-bar { padding: 20px 28px; gap: 20px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 580px) {
    .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  /* INTERNET ENABLED SECTION */
  .internet-section {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #02081a 0%, #040d22 100%);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .internet-section::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 50%, rgba(0,212,255,0.07) 0%, transparent 65%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .internet-banner {
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--cyan), #0099cc);
    color: var(--navy);
    text-align: center;
    padding: 18px 40px;
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: 22px;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .vs-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    gap: 0;
    align-items: stretch;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto 60px;
  }
  .vs-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 36px 32px;
  }
  .vs-card.theirs {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
  .vs-card.ours {
    background: rgba(0,212,255,0.07);
    border-color: var(--cyan);
    box-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(0,212,255,0.12);
  }
  .vs-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .vs-label.bad { color: #ff6b6b; }
  .vs-label.good { color: var(--cyan); }
  .vs-title {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .vs-title.bad { color: #ff6b6b; }
  .vs-title.good { color: var(--cyan); }
  .vs-points { list-style: none; }
  .vs-points li {
    padding: 11px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .vs-points li .mark { flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 16px; }
  .vs-divider {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }
  .vs-bubble {
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    background: var(--red);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: 22px;
    color: white;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(232,25,44,0.4);
  }
  .sim-badge {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    background: rgba(0,212,255,0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,212,255,0.25);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 24px 32px;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .sim-icon { font-size: 48px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .sim-text-title {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: 24px;
    color: var(--cyan);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .sim-text-body {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .vs-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .vs-divider { padding: 20px 0; }
    .vs-bubble { width: 50px; height: 50px; font-size: 18px; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-text">
    <span class="hero-badge">🌐 India's #1 Internet-Enabled Fleet DashCam</span>
    <h1 class="hero-title">DISHI FLEET<br><span>DASHCAM</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">No WiFi hotspot needed. No extra internet device. Our dashcam has its own built-in SIM — watch live video from anywhere in India, on any network, instantly.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="tel:+91XXXXXXXXXX" class="btn-primary">📞 Call to Order Now</a>
      <a href="#pricing" class="btn-secondary">See Pricing →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-img">
    <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Dishi Fleet DashCam Intro">
  </div>
</section>

<!-- TRUST BAR -->
<div class="trust-bar">
  <div class="trust-item"><span class="icon">🌐</span> Built-in SIM / Internet</div>
  <div class="trust-item"><span class="icon">📡</span> Live Video Monitoring</div>
  <div class="trust-item"><span class="icon">🎙️</span> Two-Way Cabin Audio</div>
  <div class="trust-item"><span class="icon">📍</span> Inbuilt GPS</div>
  <div class="trust-item"><span class="icon">🔁</span> Loop Recording</div>
  <div class="trust-item"><span class="icon">🛡️</span> Insurance Support</div>
</div>

<!-- SALES SPEECH -->
<section class="speech-section">
  <div class="speech-grid">
    <div class="speech-img">
      <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Dishi DashCam Product">
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="section-label">Why Every Fleet Owner Needs This</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">PROTECT YOUR FLEET.<br>GROW YOUR BUSINESS.</h2>
      <div class="speech-body">
        <p>Every day your trucks are on the road, they face risks — accidents, false claims, driver misconduct, and cargo theft. Without proof, you pay. With a <strong>Dishi Fleet DashCam</strong>, you're protected 24/7.</p>
        <div class="speech-highlight">
          "One dashcam can save you lakhs in false insurance claims. It pays for itself the very first time it's needed."
        </div>
        <p>Here's what makes us different from every other dashcam in the market: <strong>Other dashcams use WiFi — which means they need a mobile phone or hotspot nearby to connect to the internet.</strong> The moment your driver moves away from the hotspot, you lose the live feed.</p>
        <p>Our dashcam is <strong>Internet-Enabled with a built-in SIM card</strong>. It connects directly to the mobile network on its own — no phone needed, no hotspot needed. You get live video from anywhere in India, on any network, at any time.</p>
        <p>With <strong>inbuilt GPS, loop recording, and two-way cabin audio</strong>, you stay in full control of your fleet without being physically present. Issue instructions to your driver. Check road conditions. Review footage instantly.</p>
        <p>Two variants — <strong>Front Only</strong> and <strong>Front + Cabin</strong> — mean there's a solution for every budget. Starting at just ₹10,000 + GST, this is the smartest investment you'll make for your fleet this year.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- INTERNET ENABLED VS WIFI -->
<section class="internet-section">
  <div class="section-label" style="text-align:center;">The Biggest Advantage</div>
  <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align:center;">WHY INTERNET-ENABLED<br>BEATS <span style="color:var(--red);">WIFI DASHCAMS</span></h2>
  <p class="section-sub" style="text-align:center;margin:0 auto 40px;">Most fleet dashcams on the market depend on WiFi — which means they depend on a phone or hotspot sitting inside the vehicle. That's a serious limitation. Here's why ours is fundamentally different.</p>

  <div class="internet-banner">
    🌐 DISHI DASHCAM HAS ITS OWN BUILT-IN SIM CARD — NO EXTRA DEVICE NEEDED
  </div>

  <div class="vs-grid">
    <div class="vs-card theirs">
      <div class="vs-label bad">❌ Other Dashcams</div>
      <div class="vs-title bad">WiFi Dashcam</div>
      <ul class="vs-points">
        <li><span class="mark">❌</span> Needs a phone or WiFi hotspot inside the vehicle at all times</li>
        <li><span class="mark">❌</span> No hotspot = No live video. You're blind.</li>
        <li><span class="mark">❌</span> Driver can disconnect the hotspot phone anytime</li>
        <li><span class="mark">❌</span> Depends on driver's data plan or a separate SIM device</li>
        <li><span class="mark">❌</span> Extra monthly cost for a dedicated hotspot device</li>
        <li><span class="mark">❌</span> Connection drops in tunnels, highways, remote areas</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="vs-divider">
      <div class="vs-bubble">VS</div>
    </div>
    <div class="vs-card ours">
      <div class="vs-label good">✅ Dishi Fleet DashCam</div>
      <div class="vs-title good">Internet-Enabled Dashcam</div>
      <ul class="vs-points">
        <li><span class="mark">✅</span> Built-in SIM card — connects to mobile network directly</li>
        <li><span class="mark">✅</span> Live video from anywhere in India, any network, any time</li>
        <li><span class="mark">✅</span> No phone needed inside the vehicle. Fully independent.</li>
        <li><span class="mark">✅</span> Driver cannot cut off your access — ever</li>
        <li><span class="mark">✅</span> One device does everything — camera + internet + GPS</li>
        <li><span class="mark">✅</span> Works even in low signal areas on India's mobile network</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="sim-badge">
    <div class="sim-icon">📶</div>
    <div>
      <div class="sim-text-title">Plug In. Power On. Go Live.</div>
      <div class="sim-text-body">The Dishi Fleet DashCam connects to the internet the moment it powers on — using its own built-in SIM. No setup, no hotspot, no dependency on the driver's phone. You see live video. Always.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FEATURES -->
<section class="features-section">
  <div class="features-header">
    <div class="section-label">What Makes It Powerful</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">KEY FEATURES</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Six powerful features engineered for commercial fleets operating in India's toughest conditions.</p>
  </div>
  <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64,